		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>メイン　メニューに
戻ります</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mizuguchi_mai:W00226"
				Time="2011-08-29T06:20:14" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="nagihashi_toru:W00268"
				Time="2011-06-24T01:37:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="KEYSYS_STR_22"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>せきがいせんつうしんを　おこないます
DSを　むかいあわせに　してください</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nagihashi_toru:W00268"
				Time="2011-06-24T01:52:06" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="nagihashi_toru:W00268"
				Time="2011-06-24T01:37:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>赤外線通信を　おこないます
DSを　むかいあわせに　してください</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nagihashi_toru:W00268"
				Time="2011-06-24T01:52:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="nagihashi_toru:W00268"
				Time="2011-06-24T01:37:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="KEYSYS_STR_23"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>なんいどを　かえることが　できます
げんざいの　なんいどは　かんたん</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nagihashi_toru:W00268"
				Time="2011-06-24T01:52:56" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="nagihashi_toru:W00268"
				Time="2011-06-24T01:37:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>難易度を　変えることが　できます
現在の　難易度は　かんたん</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="mizuguchi_mai:W00226"
				Time="2011-08-29T06:18:04" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="nagihashi_toru:W00268"
				Time="2011-06-24T01:37:18" />
		</LanguageCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
